# 37: walk the cursor onto the APPENDED wheel cell 0x10 (Huitzil/Phobos's
# native vs2 id) and pick it. Path from the default Demitri cell 0x01:
# D -> 0x06, D -> 0x08, D -> 0x10 via the wheel extension's inbound edge
# (edges_in: 0x08 D -> 0x10). The cell-0x13 twin is replay 36.
# BUILD-ONLY replay: on vanilla vsavj the final D lands on 0x0B — this
# script is meaningful only on a build carrying the extended wheel AND a
# tenant at id 0x10 (the H gfx rung, 14z-67).
300-305 sys=C1
800-803 sys=S1
1000-1002 p1=D
1040-1042 p1=D
1080-1082 p1=D
1700-1702 p1=1
3600 wait
